'''White Gift Talisman''' is a {{Common}} [[Accessories|Accessory]] that grants the [[player]] {{Green|+5%}} [[Coins|Coin]] and [[Skills|EXP]] rewards from [[Gift|gifts]].

== Obtaining ==
=== Purchase ===
The '''White Gift Talisman''' can be purchased from {{NPCSprite|Einary}} at {{Zone|Einary's Emporium}} in {{Zone|Jerry's Workshop}}.

Note: This item is purchasable only during '''December of real life'''. When attempting to buy it outside the period, the player will get a "Only sold in December!" error message. This applies to all upgrade purchases too.
